# o365pop — AI Context

> Read this file at the start of every conversation or task. It is the map; the other docs are the territory.

---

## What Is o365pop

Local LibreELEC daemon that lets vintage POP/SMTP clients (Entourage 2008) talk to Microsoft 365. WireGuard is the security layer. Celery syncs Graph and tosses mail; `popd`/`smtpd` only speak the wire protocols.

---

## Architecture Quick Reference

- **Tech stack:** Python 3.14 package, SQLite, Celery + Redis, httpx + MSAL, aiosmtpd, Twisted POP3, maildir
- **Key design decisions:** Fido tosser; daemons never call Graph; cleartext POP/SMTP on the WG bind; one mailbox
- **Full details:** `docs/architecture/SAO.md`

